  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "有一种名叫盖诺赛克特的宝可梦，\n你肯定是知道它的吧？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E0079CD540D53EB76D68BFA8D5B514B727976845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A4F6080AF5B9A662F77E590535B8376845427FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "知道",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "77E590530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不知道",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D77E590530000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "能承认自己有不知道的事物\n是件很了不起的事。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "80FD627F8BA481EA5DF167094E0D77E5905376844E8B7269000A662F4EF65F884E864E0D8D7776844E8B30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你似乎并不是不懂装懂，\n但我还是想要说明一下，请多担待。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604F3C4E4E5E764E0D662F4E0D61C288C561C2FF0C000A4F4662118FD8662F60F389818BF4660E4E004E0BFF0C8BF7591A62C55F8530020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "盖诺赛克特是一种\n古生代的虫宝可梦。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n据说它被某个组织改造，\n可以将4种卡带插入身体。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 344,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76D68BFA8D5B514B7279662F4E0079CD000A53E4751F4EE37684866B5B9D53EF68A6300200100001BE01000A636E8BF45B8388AB67D04E2A7EC47EC765399020FF0C000A53EF4EE55C06003479CD53615E2663D251658EAB4F5330020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而我的手上不知为何有4盘卡带。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C62117684624B4E0A4E0D77E54E3A4F556709003476D853615E2630020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你要是愿意，就试着集齐4盘卡带吧。\n我会给你一些特别的情报的。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608981662F613F610FFF0C5C318BD5774096C69F50003476D853615E2654273002000A62114F1A7ED94F604E004E9B7279522B768460C562A5768430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我不是叫你集齐4盘卡带嘛！\n卡带可以用超级碎片来交换。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果你让宝可梦携带了卡带，\n记得要放回腰包里啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 548,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E0D662F53EB4F6096C69F50003476D853615E26561BFF01000A53615E2653EF4EE575288D857EA7788E724767654EA46362300200100001BE01000A5982679C4F608BA95B9D53EF68A6643A5E264E8653615E26FF0C000A8BB05F978981653E56DE8170530591CC554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你居然真的集齐4盘卡带了啊。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那我就来为你这个老实人\n提供一点压箱底的情报吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C457136771F768496C69F50003476D853615E264E86554A300200100001BE01000A90A362115C3167654E3A4F608FD94E2A80015B9E4EBA000A63D04F9B4E0070B9538B7BB15E95768460C562A5542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "给你的手机洛托姆……\n哔哔哔～地发送可疑的情报！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 748,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7ED94F607684624B673A6D1B625859C620262026000A54D454D454D4FF5E573053D1900153EF7591768460C562A5FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我给你的手机发了一个坐标，\n你去那个地方看看吧。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 800,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117ED94F607684624B673A53D14E864E004E2A57506807FF0C000A4F6053BB90A34E2A573065B9770B770B542730020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那家伙就是盖诺赛克特！\n你可绝对要捉住它啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35BB64F195C31662F76D68BFA8D5B514B7279FF01000A4F6053EF7EDD5BF9898163494F4F5B83554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你快捉住盖诺赛克特啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605FEB63494F4F76D68BFA8D5B514B7279554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "真是不得了啊。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "771F662F4E0D5F974E86554A30020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这次经历还挺有趣的吧？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果你感觉还算满意，\n今后就也请多关照了。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
